{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Getting the Client", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Negotiating Round One", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 9, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Present advice on solving technical problems in a work context and appropriate for the interlocutor. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Expressing the Future Using <span class=\"italic\">Will</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<p>One of the most common ways of talking about <span class=\"strong\">the future</span> in English is by using the auxiliary verb <span class=\"italic\">will</span>. Here's how to form and talk about <span class=\"strong\">the future</span> with <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.</p>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Affirmative Form = subject + <span class=\"italic\">will</span>/<span class=\"italic\">'ll</span> + verb", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">We'll offer top-of-the-line services.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Using <span class=\"italic\">Will </span> to Talk About the <span class=\"strong\">Future</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>We use <span class=\"italic\">will </span>to talk about decisions made at the time of speaking.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">We'll have a budget ready for you at our next meeting.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>We use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> to talk about facts or events in the future.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">We'll establish a very strong social platform through our website.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>We use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> to make predictions based on personal opinions.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">A website will provide us the ability to include and incorporate social media. </span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Asking for Clarification", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "In a business negotiation, sometimes you don't understand what was said or something was not clear to you. It is, therefore, important to express your lack of understanding and seek clarification from the person you are talking to in order to successfully negotiate a deal.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Clarifying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Clarification\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li><span class=\\\"italic\\\">To put it simply,</span> ... (+ clause)</li><li><span class=\\\"italic\\\">In other words</span> ... (+ clause)</li><li><span class=\\\"italic\\\">In fact,</span> ... (+ clause)</li><li><span class=\\\"italic\\\">To put it simply, </span>... (+ clause)</li><li><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Simply put,</span> ... (+ clause)</li><li><span class=\\\"italic\\\">In short,</span> ... (+ clause)</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can you tell ... what that means in practical terms?  </span></li><li><span class=\\\"italic\\\">What does ... mean in financial / practical / personal terms?</span></li><li><span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm not sure I know what you mean by ... ?</span></li><li><span class=\\\"italic\\\">So you're telling me that</span> ... (+ clause)<span class=\\\"italic\\\">?</span></li><li><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Have / Do / Are you?  </span></li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">So you're telling me that</span> we need a new marketing system?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">That's correct.</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">What does that mean in</span> financial <span class=\"strong\">terms?</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Well, in short, it means</span> we need to spend more.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "global trend", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a pattern of thought or activity currently happening throughout the world ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: So you're telling me we'll need to follow more relevant global media trends?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear in business negotiations. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "top-of-the-line", "type": "name"}, {"content": "belonging to the highest quality or most expensive class", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You will have top-of-the-line PR services.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "shorthand ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a shortened or abbreviated form of writing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sorry that my shorthand is hard to read.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "field research", "type": "name"}, {"content": "facts gathered from a particular location that is most relevant to the study", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Our South American team is going to do field-research.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to come together", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to start to be effective because different parts are combining well", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Our South American team is coming together.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to establish connections", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make contact with the people needed who can support your goal", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We have a man down in Colombia at the moment establishing some connections.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "waste time", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to spend time in a useless or unproductive way", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Polygon doesn't waste time, I see.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "relevance ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "being connected with something else", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have full confidence in the relevance of his work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le09ob06aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Imagine you and your partner are going to negotiate a business deal.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Think about what the deal is going to be about (for example: working longer hours on the weekend, proofreading a report)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Have a conversation with your partner and negotiate a deal.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you are speaking, make sure you use \u201cwill\u201d to talk about what you will do. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask for and give clarification when necessary.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I plan a business deal.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I clarify points during a negotiation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about the future.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le09ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le09ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: So you're telling me that to update our integrated marketing system we'll need to follow more relevant global media trends?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: That's right.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Can you tell me what that means in practical terms?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Sure. To put it simply, once we own our chosen website domain, we'll establish a strong social platform. That will provide us the ability to create social media websites and services. In short, complete social media networking abilities. You will have top-of-the-line PR services."}, {"image": "engenn7le09ob06re2img06.jpg", "time": "32500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: What does that mean in financial terms?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I don't feel we've discussed enough of the issues to speak about finances yet.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Alright. Finances for our next meeting. Next on the list ... I'm not sure I know what you mean by F.R.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Sorry that my shorthand is hard to read. Field research. Our South American team is coming together. In fact, we have a man down in Colombia at the moment establishing some connections."}, {"image": "engenn7le09ob06re2img07.jpg", "time": "61000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Have you? What's his background? Does he understand the cultural context?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: He's Brazilian. A big man in PR in Sao Paulo. I have full confidence in the relevance of his work.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Polygon doesn't waste time, I see.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Neither time nor resources. We'll have a budget prepared for you at our next meeting."}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le09ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le09ob06re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can ask for and give clarification.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about the future.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " When was the last time you had to negotiate?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What strategies did you use?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Let's be clear on how we proceed.", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Does Farmani have confidence in Polygon and their <span class=\"tool-